  "changes": {
    "stats": [
      "Rising gold chevrons, light trails and sparks for increases; descending blue chevrons for decreases.",
      "Intensity follows actual clamped stage deltas, up to three visual tiers.",
      "One or two stat changes are named; larger changes use compact direction/count labels, with exact stage values retained in existing battle notices and status badges.",
      "Presentation queue reserves 1240 ms for stat animation; reduced motion keeps the textual state.",
      "Label geometry stays in the scene and reserves the compact enemy health/weather corner.",
      "Native stroked SVG outlines, no new raster assets, no CSS blur filters on the new effect."
    ],
    "weather": [
      "44px accessible button; mouse hover, keyboard focus, click and touch.",
      "Touch is committed on pointerup; the compatibility click is ignored so Safari does not immediately toggle it again.",
      "Descriptions for rain, sun, sandstorm and snow/hail reflect current RiftMon mechanics.",
      "Map persistence and remaining turn counts use server metadata; older messages can omit duration.",
      "Outside interaction, Escape, weather changes, visibility and battle reset dismiss the help.",
      "Constrained scrollable content, French/English and journal palettes.",
      "Weather interaction does not fast-forward experience rewards."
    ]
  },
